eo Tutorial and Video Glossary explaining all the technologies and buildings in game or on our YouTube channel.\u00a0 Walk troughs for each Scenario are also there so you can have confidence you'll have the tips you'll need to get started Powering the Future!</p>","developers":["simnetzero-dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821180/073aedd2537ab87365af37cb849d44f1c61c5dd3/header.jpg?t=1766272852","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 13 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821180/1538371396/5f44174bf88d917d1a5989c9026bf68c26066739/1766068447/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766069680","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821180/1538371396/5f44174bf88d917d1a5989c9026bf68c26066739/1766068447/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766069680","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821180/1538371396/5f44174bf88d917d1a5989c9026bf68c26066739/1766068447/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766069680","id":257252141,"name":"Start Game First Turn","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c